cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CREST in your work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "CREST"
abstract: >-
  CREST (Chunked Rust Engine for Single-cell Transcriptomics) runs the scanpy single-cell
  RNA-seq workflow with native Rust kernels behind a scanpy-compatible Python API, streaming
  raw counts chunk by chunk from memory or from disk.
